WEBVTT

00:00:02.974 --> 00:00:05.274
The prime minister requested Aoi personally?

00:00:05.274 --> 00:00:08.584
Yes. She's been requested
to transport that case

00:00:08.584 --> 00:00:12.784
to the prime minister for the
international conference

00:00:12.784 --> 00:00:14.554
in Stockholm tomorrow.

00:00:16.524 --> 00:00:18.094
What's inside?

00:00:18.094 --> 00:00:20.264
We haven't been told.

00:00:20.264 --> 00:00:25.294
But doubtless it's something that will
alter the course of Japan's destiny.

00:00:25.294 --> 00:00:27.064
Japan's destiny...

00:00:27.064 --> 00:00:30.204
The time limit for delivery is midnight, local time.

00:00:30.204 --> 00:00:34.734
Since he wants the delivery kept quiet,
he can't use his private jet.

00:00:36.974 --> 00:00:38.844
Aoi Nogami...

00:00:38.844 --> 00:00:42.914
The only person who can
complete this mission

00:00:42.914 --> 00:00:45.944
is a Level 7 teleporter like her.

00:00:48.324 --> 00:00:51.224
Kanari kiteru Muteki no Power!

00:00:51.624 --> 00:00:54.494
Maji de ii kanji

00:00:54.864 --> 00:00:57.624
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:00:58.064 --> 00:01:01.224
Ashita e saa ikou!

00:01:03.174 --> 00:01:04.304
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:04.304 --> 00:01:05.474
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:01:05.474 --> 00:01:06.744
Zettai Karen Children
Zettai!

00:01:06.744 --> 00:01:08.404
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:08.404 --> 00:01:09.434
Zettai Karen Children
Daitan!

00:01:09.614 --> 00:01:12.914
Fureau dake de wakaru

00:01:12.914 --> 00:01:15.344
Kokoro no limiter

00:01:16.084 --> 00:01:18.774
Tokihanatareta hora

00:01:19.184 --> 00:01:22.384
Yes! Change the world!

00:01:22.624 --> 00:01:25.494
Atsui battle Nandomo try!

00:01:25.794 --> 00:01:29.094
Real wo tsuranuite

00:01:29.094 --> 00:01:32.334
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:01:32.334 --> 00:01:35.264
Thrill ga SAIKOU!

00:01:36.404 --> 00:01:42.874
Yuuki ga sekai no yami wo terashi hajimeru

00:01:42.874 --> 00:01:48.814
Anata ga kureta kiseki afureru

00:01:49.254 --> 00:01:55.644
Darenimo nitenai egao hokori ni shitara

00:01:55.854 --> 00:02:00.394
Mirai wo ima koeyou

00:02:00.394 --> 00:02:04.494
We can try over the future world!

00:02:04.734 --> 00:02:05.094
Yeah!

00:02:05.834 --> 00:02:06.494
Saidai!

00:02:08.634 --> 00:02:09.864
Daitan!

00:02:21.744 --> 00:02:24.414
12th sense.
"Destination! Teleport Japan's Future!!"

00:02:25.054 --> 00:02:26.244
ARITHMETIC ANSWER SHEET -
KAORU AKASHI

00:02:26.454 --> 00:02:27.684
ARITHMETIC ANSWER SHEET -
MASARU TONO

00:02:29.194 --> 00:02:31.214
You might have beaten me on the test,
but you won't beat me at dodge ball!

00:02:32.324 --> 00:02:34.764
I'm ready for you! C'mon, right now!

00:02:36.394 --> 00:02:38.594
Just what are you two going on about?!

00:02:40.304 --> 00:02:42.864
This isn't time for PE, okay?

00:02:43.374 --> 00:02:44.924
Right...

00:02:46.704 --> 00:02:51.114
Why do people insist on putting
pineapple into sweet and sour pork?

00:02:51.444 --> 00:02:54.034
Miss Sannomiya, don't be picky with your food.

00:02:55.384 --> 00:02:57.614
Miss Yamabe, would you say that to someone

00:02:57.614 --> 00:02:59.344
who'd die from eating pineapple?

00:03:00.884 --> 00:03:02.754
Well, you won't, will you?!

00:03:03.724 --> 00:03:05.314
Okay!

00:03:08.594 --> 00:03:10.564
Uh-oh! It took me so long to find
So, how are the new transfer students?
Giving you any trouble?

00:03:10.564 --> 00:03:11.994
these books in the library, recess is over!
So, how are the new transfer students?
Giving you any trouble?

00:03:11.994 --> 00:03:13.064
these books in the library, recess is over!
Hm... Akashi, maybe.

00:03:13.064 --> 00:03:15.124
Hm... Akashi, maybe.

00:03:15.634 --> 00:03:19.004
She's the biggest handful of the three.

00:03:19.004 --> 00:03:20.874
Can't stand to be shown up by any boys.

00:03:20.874 --> 00:03:23.934
Oh, and Sannomiya has a tendency to talk back,

00:03:24.314 --> 00:03:27.184
but they're no more trouble than normal.

00:03:27.184 --> 00:03:29.114
And what about the one with the glasses?

00:03:29.114 --> 00:03:32.414
Nogami? Let's see. She's...

00:03:33.184 --> 00:03:35.154
No trouble at all, I guess.

00:03:35.154 --> 00:03:38.714
Still, it's the troublesome kids
you love the most, right?

00:03:41.524 --> 00:03:44.364
Okay? There are 40 kids in the class.

00:03:44.734 --> 00:03:48.434
It's divided into 3 groups.
Group A has 3 more than Group B.

00:03:48.434 --> 00:03:51.934
Group B has 5 more than Group C. Therefore...

00:03:51.934 --> 00:03:54.374
These boobs are SO fake!

00:03:54.704 --> 00:03:57.114
You can't really tell without touching them, so...

00:03:57.114 --> 00:03:59.144
Where's the appeal of some lady cyborg?

00:03:59.144 --> 00:04:02.654
LISTEN! You guys don't understand! That's why-

00:04:02.654 --> 00:04:04.814
Even if we listened, we wouldn't get it.

00:04:04.814 --> 00:04:09.084
First of all, that class is weird!
Why make the groups all different sizes?

00:04:09.084 --> 00:04:11.854
So, just tell us!

00:04:12.094 --> 00:04:14.784
Don't just assume that life is a bowl of cherries!

00:04:15.064 --> 00:04:15.724
Don't hog the answers!

00:04:15.724 --> 00:04:16.334
I'm home.
Don't hog the answers!

00:04:16.334 --> 00:04:17.594
I'm home.
I'll take you, right now!

00:04:17.594 --> 00:04:18.924
What?!

00:04:20.604 --> 00:04:22.154
What are you all doing?!

00:04:24.874 --> 00:04:25.674
Minamoto!

00:04:25.674 --> 00:04:26.934
Mr. Minamoto!

00:04:27.244 --> 00:04:28.744
Ow...

00:04:28.744 --> 00:04:30.904
No psychic battles in the house!

00:04:32.474 --> 00:04:34.574
I wasn't doing anything wrong.

00:04:35.084 --> 00:04:38.884
Homework, huh? Won't you teach them, Aoi?

00:04:38.884 --> 00:04:39.784
Sure.

00:04:39.784 --> 00:04:43.694
Right! We're a team! We're supposed
to support each other!

00:04:43.694 --> 00:04:45.954
You guys are always like this!

00:04:46.364 --> 00:04:47.364
Aoi?

00:04:47.364 --> 00:04:49.394
Out in the field, you rely on
me to move you around,

00:04:49.394 --> 00:04:51.634
and then you end up taking all the credit!

00:04:51.634 --> 00:04:53.334
You cut me out, all the time!

00:04:53.334 --> 00:04:54.904
What are you talking about?

00:04:54.904 --> 00:04:56.774
We don't mean to!

00:04:56.774 --> 00:04:59.244
Even if you don't mean to, you still do it!

00:04:59.244 --> 00:05:02.144
Everybody loves the troublemakers the best!

00:05:02.274 --> 00:05:05.074
Even you, Mr. Minamoto! You like
Kaoru and Shiho best, don't you?!

00:05:05.574 --> 00:05:07.244
Aoi, what are you saying?!

00:05:07.244 --> 00:05:07.984
Aoi!

00:05:07.984 --> 00:05:09.214
Wait!
Aoi!

00:05:09.214 --> 00:05:12.884
Don't follow me! I can't even
look at you anymore!

00:05:12.884 --> 00:05:14.354
Aoi, wait.

00:05:14.354 --> 00:05:16.414
I said, don't follow me!

00:05:16.794 --> 00:05:19.664
I have to discuss a sudden solo mission for you.

00:05:19.664 --> 00:05:20.864
A solo mission?

00:05:20.864 --> 00:05:23.854
Well, more accurately, it's
going to be you and me.

00:05:25.294 --> 00:05:27.894
Just you and me, Mr. Minamoto?

00:05:28.934 --> 00:05:30.034
Just Aoi?

00:05:30.034 --> 00:05:31.734
No fair!

00:05:32.574 --> 00:05:36.664
You guys can stay here and
do homework. On your own!

00:05:47.724 --> 00:05:50.454
I just have to deliver that case
to the prime minister, right?

00:05:50.454 --> 00:05:53.624
Apparently, it's something that can
change the course of Japan's destiny.

00:05:53.624 --> 00:05:55.324
Treat this with the utmost importance.

00:05:55.324 --> 00:05:57.354
Okay, shall we go?

00:05:58.534 --> 00:06:01.694
Special esper, Aoi Nogami: released.

00:06:03.674 --> 00:06:07.704
Sensitive, passionate, and on my own!
I fly upon invisible wings!

00:06:07.704 --> 00:06:10.174
The Absolute Lovely Children! Aoi Nogami!

00:06:12.174 --> 00:06:14.144
They even do it by themselves...

00:06:14.544 --> 00:06:15.044
Okay!

00:06:15.044 --> 00:06:15.874
No, wait!

00:06:20.754 --> 00:06:22.774
Here we go! Consecutive teleportation!

00:06:32.764 --> 00:06:34.594
A-Aoi! Wait!

00:06:35.304 --> 00:06:37.734
Flying around like this will
wear you out in no time!

00:06:40.904 --> 00:06:44.774
Hold it to a pace of six or
seven hundred meters...

00:06:45.674 --> 00:06:47.244
a second!

00:06:47.244 --> 00:06:49.444
Will we make it at that rate?

00:06:50.584 --> 00:06:53.454
It works out to an effective speed of Mach 2!

00:06:54.154 --> 00:06:55.814
Which is fine!

00:06:56.654 --> 00:06:58.954
We can make it there in three...

00:06:59.894 --> 00:07:00.864
...and a half...

00:07:02.564 --> 00:07:03.894
...hours!

00:07:04.894 --> 00:07:07.194
Besides, you need to rest occasionally!

00:07:08.034 --> 00:07:10.064
It won't be...

00:07:10.774 --> 00:07:12.534
...easy for you to...

00:07:12.974 --> 00:07:15.564
...perform over twelve thousand...

00:07:16.574 --> 00:07:19.174
...consecutive teleports!

00:07:19.174 --> 00:07:20.844
T-Twelve thousand?!

00:07:21.614 --> 00:07:24.174
Wow, suddenly I'm not that gung ho about this.

00:07:27.524 --> 00:07:29.924
AOI!

00:07:30.894 --> 00:07:33.654
I can hear you fine without the yelling, you know.

00:07:34.394 --> 00:07:36.134
Aoi, don't break your rhythm!

00:07:36.134 --> 00:07:38.794
The climbs and descents will cut your range!

00:07:38.794 --> 00:07:40.094
Oh. Right.

00:07:40.504 --> 00:07:43.064
I'm gonna be so sick later.

00:07:50.174 --> 00:07:53.514
What brought that on? What's up, Aoi?

00:07:54.014 --> 00:07:56.214
Is there a park or a convenience
store around here?

00:07:56.214 --> 00:07:58.444
Of course there isn't!

00:07:59.054 --> 00:08:00.284
But...

00:08:00.384 --> 00:08:02.614
Huh? Oh... You have to pee?

00:08:04.924 --> 00:08:07.554
Don't just say it like that! I'm a lady!

00:08:09.734 --> 00:08:13.224
Cocoa, with plenty of milk in it.

00:08:13.464 --> 00:08:14.724
Thanks.

00:08:19.074 --> 00:08:22.204
We've been flying for a while,
but it hasn't gotten dark at all.

00:08:22.774 --> 00:08:24.644
White nights.

00:08:25.144 --> 00:08:26.314
White nights?

00:08:26.314 --> 00:08:28.284
This area's at a high latitude.

00:08:28.284 --> 00:08:30.754
So the sun doesn't set at this time of year.

00:08:53.574 --> 00:08:56.204
I wish I could show this to Shiho and Kaoru.

00:08:57.844 --> 00:09:01.334
Didn't you say you didn't want
to look at them anymore?

00:09:01.484 --> 00:09:03.914
You're right! We're mad at each other now!

00:09:23.334 --> 00:09:24.474
Wh-What's that?!

00:09:24.474 --> 00:09:26.034
That's the Roviet military!

00:09:26.034 --> 00:09:29.244
Attention, espers in flight!
Take my course at once!

00:09:29.244 --> 00:09:31.444
Esper airspace violation in a serious offense!

00:09:31.444 --> 00:09:32.884
Comply, or I will open fire!

00:09:32.884 --> 00:09:36.254
W-Wait! We're Japanese government personnel!

00:09:36.254 --> 00:09:38.614
We filed flight clearance through our embassy!

00:09:38.614 --> 00:09:40.744
I say again! Take my heading at once!

00:09:41.524 --> 00:09:43.094
What's going on, Mr. Minamoto?!

00:09:43.094 --> 00:09:46.614
Calm down, it's okay. Probably a
communications mistake on their end.

00:09:47.164 --> 00:09:49.564
If you disregard my orders,
I will shoot you down!

00:09:49.564 --> 00:09:51.764
Wait!

00:09:51.764 --> 00:09:54.364
Do we have time to be questioned at their base?

00:09:54.364 --> 00:09:56.594
All right! We'll come with you!

00:10:11.114 --> 00:10:12.954
That's ECM, right?

00:10:12.954 --> 00:10:16.294
Yeah. Esper countermeasures
are a serious matter

00:10:16.294 --> 00:10:19.314
at military installations in every country.

00:10:21.424 --> 00:10:25.464
Colonel, we've brought the illegal
alien esper and her companion.

00:10:25.464 --> 00:10:27.294
Right. Bring them in.

00:10:38.644 --> 00:10:43.374
I am Col. Pirotskysky, this
base's commander, vodka.

00:10:50.554 --> 00:10:52.324
It. Koichi Minamoto, attached to BABEL,

00:10:52.324 --> 00:10:54.964
a special agency of the Japanese government.

00:10:54.964 --> 00:10:56.764
We're in a rush, Colonel, so-

00:10:56.764 --> 00:10:59.354
Put them in detention, vodka!

00:11:02.334 --> 00:11:06.464
Wait, please! What's going on?! Colonel!

00:11:10.114 --> 00:11:12.874
Win BABEL merchandise with scratch cards!

00:11:14.944 --> 00:11:17.884
No way! Seriously? Is there
any merchandise with me?

00:11:24.894 --> 00:11:28.324
There must be some mistake!
You can verify this with our embassy!

00:11:28.324 --> 00:11:31.494
Please! We're on a mission!

00:11:33.164 --> 00:11:34.094
Dammit!

00:11:35.934 --> 00:11:38.304
They confiscated the case, too.

00:11:38.304 --> 00:11:41.574
There may be no way for us to
make it there in time, now.

00:11:41.574 --> 00:11:43.634
Will our failure...

00:11:45.374 --> 00:11:49.114
Will our failure become a
failure for The Children?

00:11:57.054 --> 00:12:01.514
Didn't you take this mission to
show up the other two girls?

00:12:04.864 --> 00:12:06.964
Out in the field, you rely on
me to move you around,

00:12:06.964 --> 00:12:08.964
and then you end up taking all the credit!

00:12:08.964 --> 00:12:10.734
You cut me out, all the time!

00:12:11.374 --> 00:12:15.044
Why did I say all that stuff?

00:12:15.044 --> 00:12:19.414
I never used to think about who
got credit for stuff before.

00:12:19.414 --> 00:12:22.074
Kaoru and Shiho feel the same way.

00:12:24.114 --> 00:12:26.424
Just before we left...

00:12:26.424 --> 00:12:29.754
This solo mission isn't dangerous, is it?

00:12:29.754 --> 00:12:31.724
Can't we go with you?

00:12:34.564 --> 00:12:38.894
Your going with us would only
make this harder on her.

00:12:39.664 --> 00:12:42.934
Long-distance, continuous
consecutive teleportations...

00:12:42.934 --> 00:12:45.134
puts Aoi under a lot of strain.

00:12:46.204 --> 00:12:47.974
If you think about it,

00:12:47.974 --> 00:12:50.874
you know what's best for her, right?

00:12:53.784 --> 00:12:55.784
We'll wait up till you're back!

00:12:55.784 --> 00:12:58.114
And if anything happens, we'll
fly out there in a flash!

00:13:03.324 --> 00:13:05.584
They really said that?

00:13:06.394 --> 00:13:10.024
No matter what, you girls are a team.

00:13:10.634 --> 00:13:11.564
A team...

00:13:15.434 --> 00:13:16.524
That's right!

00:13:18.374 --> 00:13:21.234
Are you comfortable, caviar?

00:13:21.444 --> 00:13:26.204
Colonel Pirotskysky! Did you
contact the embassy?

00:13:26.514 --> 00:13:29.444
Contact your embassy? Hmpf...

00:13:29.444 --> 00:13:32.284
What makes you think I had any
intention of doing that, caviar?

00:13:33.154 --> 00:13:36.914
We can't allow you to deliver that case, caviar.

00:13:37.524 --> 00:13:40.894
You mean... You're trying to disrupt
the international conference!

00:13:40.894 --> 00:13:43.894
The Roviet government ordered you to do this?!

00:13:43.894 --> 00:13:46.834
Sadly, the Roviet government
has nothing to do with it.

00:13:46.834 --> 00:13:48.464
There are nations that can't afford...

00:13:48.464 --> 00:13:51.074
to let that conference end successfully, caviar.

00:13:51.074 --> 00:13:53.764
You... You're an international spy?!

00:13:59.214 --> 00:14:02.844
You're gonna be sorry that you did this to us!

00:14:04.884 --> 00:14:07.224
Your babbling means nothing in the end, caviar!

00:14:07.224 --> 00:14:08.884
Once I've seen that the conference has failed,

00:14:08.884 --> 00:14:11.624
I'll give you plenty of people to fight, caviar!

00:14:11.624 --> 00:14:14.164
Hold it! What are you planning to do with us?!

00:14:14.164 --> 00:14:16.454
You need to ask, caviar?

00:14:19.264 --> 00:14:20.804
What's going on here?!

00:14:20.804 --> 00:14:23.494
Communications from the prime
minister have been intercepted.

00:14:23.634 --> 00:14:27.574
Darn it! If it weren't for this ECM,
I could do something!

00:14:27.574 --> 00:14:29.904
No, we still have an option.

00:14:40.084 --> 00:14:41.624
Is that a?!

00:14:41.624 --> 00:14:43.654
A portable ECCM.

00:14:43.654 --> 00:14:44.794
Mr. Minamoto!

00:14:44.794 --> 00:14:47.024
I brought it, just in case.

00:14:47.764 --> 00:14:50.694
But it only has 5 minutes of run time.

00:14:50.694 --> 00:14:52.564
5 minutes is all I'll need.

00:15:00.174 --> 00:15:01.174
You!

00:15:01.174 --> 00:15:02.504
Hold it, Colonel!

00:15:02.504 --> 00:15:03.974
You shouldn't underestimate us!

00:15:05.074 --> 00:15:06.244
ECCM?

00:15:06.244 --> 00:15:07.574
Too slow!

00:15:09.514 --> 00:15:11.674
I'll take my case back, thank you!

00:15:13.324 --> 00:15:15.754
Stop! Give it up, Colonel!

00:15:22.694 --> 00:15:24.254
Mr. Minamoto, come on!

00:15:27.164 --> 00:15:29.864
There's no time. I'll stay here!

00:15:31.004 --> 00:15:34.704
Get this to the prime minister.
You'll go faster without me.

00:15:35.074 --> 00:15:38.744
Besides, I have to hand over the
colonel to the Roviet government.

00:15:38.744 --> 00:15:40.574
Get going, Aoi!

00:15:43.914 --> 00:15:44.954
Aoi...

00:15:44.954 --> 00:15:47.854
Don't you dare tell Kaoru and Shiho.

00:15:50.524 --> 00:15:51.824
Be careful.

00:15:51.824 --> 00:15:55.884
Idiot! A little kid shouldn't worry
about that! You be careful-

00:15:55.964 --> 00:15:57.694
Leave it to me!

00:16:23.224 --> 00:16:24.314
Dammit!

00:16:25.824 --> 00:16:26.914
Aoi!

00:16:41.674 --> 00:16:42.834
Wh-What?!

00:16:54.384 --> 00:16:55.644
Him?!

00:16:57.424 --> 00:16:59.754
Mister, what is your problem?!

00:17:03.164 --> 00:17:06.464
You're a fugitive! I have clearance
to shoot you down!

00:17:06.764 --> 00:17:08.664
You can't be allowed to deliver

00:17:08.664 --> 00:17:11.894
whatever's in that case which will
determine Japan's destiny!

00:17:12.604 --> 00:17:18.634
Besides, I can't allow anyone who
knows my identity to live, matroska!

00:17:32.924 --> 00:17:34.654
I have an emergency message
for the Roviet government!

00:17:36.564 --> 00:17:37.294
Hurry!

00:17:40.464 --> 00:17:43.094
This is the end, matroska!

00:17:58.084 --> 00:17:59.414
Why?!

00:18:06.964 --> 00:18:09.954
Those missiles use active homing, little girl.

00:18:10.294 --> 00:18:14.194
They'll follow you straight to the
depths of Hell, matroska!

00:18:16.804 --> 00:18:18.664
I won't lose.

00:18:18.934 --> 00:18:20.404
We're a team!

00:18:20.644 --> 00:18:22.834
Do you think Aoi's okay on her own?

00:18:23.344 --> 00:18:25.674
We don't have to worry about her.

00:18:26.914 --> 00:18:28.414
Why not?

00:18:28.414 --> 00:18:31.444
Because she's one of The Children.

00:18:37.324 --> 00:18:38.824
You're right.

00:18:38.824 --> 00:18:41.954
A black mark for me is a black
mark for all of The Children.

00:18:42.294 --> 00:18:45.384
If I fail here, Kaoru and Shiho
will share my disgrace.

00:18:46.464 --> 00:18:49.264
I gotta shake these missiles!

00:18:53.174 --> 00:18:56.164
Borscht! You cannot escape, vodka!

00:19:03.284 --> 00:19:04.044
What?

00:19:04.954 --> 00:19:07.654
I told you you'd be sorry!

00:19:07.654 --> 00:19:09.744
I am one of The Children!

00:19:11.024 --> 00:19:12.184
Zubrowka!

00:19:22.504 --> 00:19:25.834
So, this is the power of a
special esper, matroska?

00:19:25.834 --> 00:19:27.474
Colonel Pirotskysky!

00:19:27.474 --> 00:19:30.604
The Roviet government knows what you are!

00:19:31.114 --> 00:19:32.904
You're under arrest for espionage!

00:19:33.174 --> 00:19:36.114
Colonel Pirotsysky, you will come with us!

00:19:36.414 --> 00:19:38.474
If you don't comply, we'll shoot you down!

00:19:40.154 --> 00:19:42.414
Matroska!

00:19:43.054 --> 00:19:46.924
Stockholm - 12:00 AM

00:19:48.424 --> 00:19:50.724
Prime Minister, she's here.

00:19:50.834 --> 00:19:52.624
Right. Send her in.

00:19:56.464 --> 00:19:57.874
You're the special esper?

00:19:57.874 --> 00:19:59.534
Uh, yes, sir!

00:20:00.844 --> 00:20:03.174
Well done. You are of great help.

00:20:10.914 --> 00:20:11.984
Here.

00:20:11.984 --> 00:20:15.814
Thank you. With this, Japan has
avoided its greatest threat.

00:20:20.324 --> 00:20:21.994
Um, Prime Minister, sir?

00:20:21.994 --> 00:20:25.894
I realize it must be very important,
but what's in there?

00:20:25.894 --> 00:20:27.424
Oh, this?

00:20:31.734 --> 00:20:33.634
A... pillow?

00:20:33.904 --> 00:20:36.804
Well, I just can't sleep on a strange pillow.

00:20:37.344 --> 00:20:40.504
It'd be just awful to spend a sleepless
night before a major conference...

00:20:41.344 --> 00:20:42.414
Something wrong?

00:20:42.414 --> 00:20:47.944
You... You sent for an esper
for a job like THAT?!

00:20:49.584 --> 00:20:51.424
And then I heard that the prime
minister himself, in tears, mind you,

00:20:51.424 --> 00:20:55.364
phoned to send a money gift and
written thanks to The Children.

00:20:56.024 --> 00:21:00.534
You mean Aoi had him thank
them all and not just her?

00:21:00.534 --> 00:21:02.504
Aoi, you had better not have!

00:21:02.834 --> 00:21:05.204
Or... Would she?!

00:21:05.204 --> 00:21:08.444
And the international conference in
Stockholm has ended successfully.

00:21:08.444 --> 00:21:12.034
with talk that our nation made a major
contribution towards world peace.

00:21:14.184 --> 00:21:15.344
Miss Nogami!

00:21:16.144 --> 00:21:17.614
Y-Yes?!

00:21:17.614 --> 00:21:21.284
How many times today have I warned
you about falling asleep?

00:21:21.284 --> 00:21:23.614
Um... Four?

00:21:23.754 --> 00:21:25.554
No! Five!

00:21:25.554 --> 00:21:27.094
Six!

00:21:27.094 --> 00:21:29.224
I told you to stay home today.

00:21:29.564 --> 00:21:32.084
Still, this is so typical of Aoi.

00:21:32.864 --> 00:21:33.534
You said it.

00:21:33.534 --> 00:21:34.764
You, two!
You said it.

00:21:35.034 --> 00:21:38.124
Akashi! Sannomiya! No talking in class!

00:21:40.604 --> 00:21:42.474
Miss Nogami!

00:21:42.674 --> 00:21:45.044
Go stand in the hallway!

00:21:45.044 --> 00:21:46.474
Yes, ma'am.

00:21:47.214 --> 00:21:51.614
Honestly, you three are such trouble!

00:21:52.814 --> 00:21:54.654
You three?

00:21:54.954 --> 00:21:56.454
Miss, we'll go, too!

00:21:56.454 --> 00:21:58.584
We'll stand together!

00:21:59.554 --> 00:22:01.554
But... Why?

00:22:02.164 --> 00:22:03.664
Because.

00:22:03.664 --> 00:22:05.064
We're...

00:22:05.064 --> 00:22:06.964
Yeah, we're...

00:22:07.234 --> 00:22:08.964
a team!

00:22:19.474 --> 00:22:24.614
Kakushitemo muda da yo

00:22:24.914 --> 00:22:28.974
Nandemo zenbu wakaru

00:22:29.724 --> 00:22:35.164
Fushigi ja nai yo datte atashi wa

00:22:35.524 --> 00:22:40.934
Anata wo ai shite n da mon

00:22:41.164 --> 00:22:45.574
Hora kochi muite

00:22:45.834 --> 00:22:50.144
Maji de love x love musubareru no wa

00:22:50.144 --> 00:22:52.114
Zettai nan desu!

00:22:52.344 --> 00:22:57.054
Zutto eien fuhen

00:22:57.054 --> 00:23:03.694
Everest kara sekaiju ni zettai sengen!

00:23:03.694 --> 00:23:08.524
Mou uketomete

00:23:08.524 --> 00:23:12.934
Futari love x love musubareru no wa

00:23:12.934 --> 00:23:15.134
Zettai nan desu!

00:23:15.134 --> 00:23:19.574
Yappa daian kibou

00:23:19.874 --> 00:23:23.974
San Pietro de chikau ai no

00:23:23.974 --> 00:23:26.774
Zettai sengen!

00:23:39.954 --> 00:23:41.024
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:41.024 --> 00:23:42.924
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.664 --> 00:23:45.564
Please write an essay.

00:23:46.764 --> 00:23:48.234
The theme will be "family."

00:23:49.534 --> 00:23:52.904
Why not go home on the weekend? You
haven't been back for a while, have you?

00:23:52.904 --> 00:23:54.664
Mom... Sis...

00:23:55.104 --> 00:23:56.874
My home is here!

00:23:56.874 --> 00:23:58.444
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:58.444 --> 00:24:02.184
Episode 13: "Home Collapse?
Operation Paradise!"

00:24:02.184 --> 00:24:04.684
Beautiful, sexy, and absolutely lovely! That's us!

00:24:04.684 --> 00:24:04.984
We'll send you to paradise!

00:24:04.984 --> 00:24:06.654
Home Collapse?
Operation Paradise!
We'll send you to paradise!

00:24:06.654 --> 00:24:08.984
Home Collapse?
Operation Paradise!
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.984 --> 00:24:09.954
Home Collapse?
Operation Paradise!
